  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-model-switcher",
      "text": "Searchable model switcher palette for DeepSeek Harness composer.\n\n- `Cmd+K` / `/` to open, searchable by name/id/description\n- Provider rail, per-row capability/context badges\n- Memory-only icon cache (80 LRU) + official CDN (`@lobehub/icons-static-svg`), no localStorage trace"
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web add \"github:jxiansen/dsh-model-switcher#main\""
    },
    {
      "section": "restart dsh --profile web",
      "text": "```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Develop",
      "text": "```bash\npnpm install\npnpm build        # bundle src/client -> lib/client.js (Harness web factory)\npnpm test         # node:test suites (utils, filter, built-bundle smoke)\npnpm lint         # eslint\n\n`src/client` is the ESM source, `lib/client.js` is the committed build\nartifact that DSH loads (do not edit by hand). Regenerate the icon index\nwith `node scripts/build-icon-toc.mjs`, then rebuild."
    }
  ],
